{"id":"n40854-1-7","stage":1,"title":"날씬하다 · 苗条","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n40854-1-7-1","ko":"이 옷은 입으시면 날씬해 보여서 인기가 많아요.","zh":"这件衣服穿上会显得很苗条，所以很受欢迎。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷은","meaning":"衣服，衣裳，服装","explanation":"옷：衣服，衣裳，服装；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"옷","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30159","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입으시면","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날씬해","meaning":"苗条，修长，颀长","explanation":"날씬하다：苗条，修长，颀长；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"날씬하다","audio":"/audio/fec6c5dc6d5202d1eaf9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40854","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씬하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보여서","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인기가","meaning":"人气","explanation":"인기：人气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"인기","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70758","senseId":"1","lemma":"인기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많아요.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"4bddf9b9203384c7","term":"옷","zh":"衣服，衣裳，服装","audio":"/audio/4bddf9b9203384c7b240.mp3","entryId":"30159","definition":"为遮掩身体、防晒抗寒以及追求美观而穿的遮挡物。","pronunciation":["옫"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"fec6c5dc6d5202d1","term":"날씬하다","zh":"苗条，修长，颀长","audio":"/audio/fec6c5dc6d5202d1eaf9.mp3","entryId":"40854","definition":"身材高挑，甚是好看。","pronunciation":["날씬하다"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"97bd6aed2c720b21","term":"인기","zh":"人气","audio":"/audio/97bd6aed2c720b21d1e4.mp3","entryId":"70758","definition":"许多人对某个对象的浓厚兴趣或喜爱之心。","pronunciation":["인끼"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/9ecbef87e785b7c46c3f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n40854-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 한번 입어 볼게요.","zh":"那我就试穿一下吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입어","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볼게요.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7243846aba23f67274ee.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=40854","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":42,"sequenceScore":1.9134,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["那我就试穿一下吧。","没有勺子，要怎么喝汤呢？","这件衣服穿上会显得很苗条，所以很受欢迎。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那我就试穿一下吧。","这件衣服穿上会显得很苗条，所以很受欢迎。","没有勺子，要怎么喝汤呢？"],"answer":0}]}
